#!/usr/bin/env bash
# Every function's description and grants, in one place. Regenerates
# functions/<name>/<name>.json; never edit those by hand (bin/fnjson.py, as Tasks').
#   table   read        table:rw  + write rows        table:rwd  + delete rows
#   /folder:read,write,delete     function:<name>  run it
set -euo pipefail
cd "$(dirname "$0")/.."
f() { uv run --no-project python bin/fnjson.py "$@"; }
f brand_setup "Brand kit's set-up: the memory block in /memory/AGENTS.md (whatever the Lemma writes or makes for the team follows its brand and voice), its guide at /memory/plugins/brand.md, and the playbooks in /brand/. Safe to run again." /brand:read,write /memory:read,write
f brand_site_style "Fetch a public web page and return ranked brand candidates: CSS custom properties that resolve to colours, colours, font stacks, @font-face families, radii, logo and icon addresses, and a warning when the page is JS-rendered. Given brand_id, keeps the CSS it read as evidence; given job_id, keeps the job's activity line." brand brand_job:rw brand_evidence:rw /brand:read,write
f brand_read "Read the team's brand from its website (url) or from a logo and brand guide uploaded to a folder (folder). The first brand is the default; reading again (brand_id, or the default) changes it for the whole team, so confirm first. Runs in the background: the Lemma's assistant reads it and a person checks it in the Brand app." brand:rw brand_job:rw
f brand_add_assets "Collect a brand's assets while reading it: each an address on the site (url) or a pod file (path), with where it was found. Downloads and keeps each, and asks what each is (logo, icon, photo, illustration, other) and whether it is the brand's own. resort asks again about assets already collected." brand brand_asset:rw brand_job:rw brand_correction /brand:read,write
f brand_save "Keep what a read found about a brand: colours by role (with what each is for and where it was found), faces, voice, the guide (markdown), logos (asset ids and variants), evidence, radius. Measures contrast, keeps a person's fixes, writes theme.css and theme.json, and asks a person to check the brand." brand:rw brand_asset:rw brand_evidence:rwd brand_job:rw brand_correction /brand:read,write
f brand_start_design "Start a design in the team's brand (title, kind, prompt), or the next version of one (design_id). Returns the version, the folder to upload index.html, theme.css, the logo and preview.png to, the size, and the brand's theme and logo paths. Then call brand_save_design." brand brand_design:rw brand_job:rw
f brand_save_design "Keep a version of a design after checking it against the brand: does it follow the brand, and which rule did it break (colour, type, logo, contrast, voice)? Never show a version that breaks the brand: fix it and make the next version." brand brand_asset brand_design:rw brand_version:rw brand_job:rw brand_correction /brand:read function:brand_needs_you
f brand_job_start "The brand-job workflow's first step: takes a wanted job (read a brand, make a design, change one) and writes the brief for the Lemma's assistant, with the playbook to follow." brand brand_job:rw brand_design brand_correction /brand:read function:brand_setup
f brand_job_end "The brand-job workflow's last step: closes the job (a read is done when the brand was saved; a design when a version was kept), puts things back when it stopped short, and writes what needs the person who asked." brand:rw brand_job:rw brand_design:rw brand_version function:brand_needs_you
f brand_needs_you "What in Brand kit needs the person, written to the shared needs_you list (Today reads it): designs they asked for waiting for their review, and the brand after a read they started, waiting for them to check it." brand brand_design brand_version brand_job needs_you:rw
f brand_fix "A person's fixes in Brand kit: a colour or a face (kept over later reads), the voice, what an asset is, whether a design follows the brand; looks_right marks the brand checked. Fixes become the examples for the next Decisions calls." brand:rw brand_asset:rw brand_version:rw brand_design:rw brand_correction:rw /brand:read,write function:brand_needs_you
f brand_design_action "What a person does with designs in the Brand app: new (ask for a design: prompt, kind, title), change (ask for the next version: design_id, prompt), approve, archive, restore." brand brand_design:rw brand_version brand_job:rw function:brand_needs_you
f brand_sample_data "load: a made-up brand (a bakery) read the way a website would be, with its assets sorted, its contrast measured, a launch post waiting for review and a banner whose off-brand first version was fixed. clear: removes only what the sample made." brand:rwd brand_asset:rwd brand_evidence:rwd brand_job:rwd brand_design:rwd brand_version:rwd brand_sample_row:rwd /brand:read,write,delete function:brand_setup function:brand_add_assets function:brand_save function:brand_start_design function:brand_save_design function:brand_needs_you
